# This workspace is saas's own composition: it composes no module behind a hop,
# so the gateway stands none here (code/gateway_hop.go reads an empty MODULES as
# "stand no hop"). A composing workspace ships its own hop group naming the
# modules its gateway fronts; the module subtree deliberately ships no default,
# because an inherited one would collide with that group, which the authority
# module's hop reads too.
MODULES=
